Package: hd-theme
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Erik Van Hamme <erik.vanhamme@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: hd-config, hd-art, hd-fonts, python3, python3-jinja2, python3-cairo, python3-gi,
 gir1.2-pango-1.0, imv
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Description: HyprDebian theme engine
 Keeps the themes of HyprDebian in /etc/hyprdebian/themes, one JSON file per
 theme, and the one theme of the system in the key hd-theme of
 /etc/hyprdebian/config.json, where hd-menu and other packages read it.
 .
 hd-theme adds, deletes and selects themes as root. Every user lists them
 with it, and applies the selected theme with it: that writes the theme files
 of kitty, Hyprland, hyprlock, hyprpaper and mako in their home
 directory. hd-theme-card renders a theme into a card, a PNG that
 hd-theme --list shows in imv-wayland.
